+  // Never truncate an existing sidecar. A reader sees the previous complete
+  // digest until the new, synced file is renamed into place. Interrupted
+  // staging files do not match any of CheckFileDigest's sidecar suffixes.
+  // A fixed short basename also supports sidecars near NAME_MAX.
+  std::string temporary = (directory / ".twrp-digest.XXXXXX").string();
